From 3544e0140a0df4450d73cd2c380eb6207f00322d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gregory Price <gourry@gourry.net>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 07:05:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] selftests/dax: add CRAM file-tier latency probe + fs-matrix
 wrapper

cram_file_perf_tool / .sh  file-tier companion to the anon-focused
                           cram_perf_tool: demotes a file's clean pages onto
                           the CRAM node and times in-place read, COW-promote
                           write, and cross-process read.
cram_fs_matrix.sh          run the CRAM file-tier tests across every filesystem
                           in CRAM_FS_LIST on a single CRAM_FS_DISK.
